   <title>Scenario: the one topic = one intent principle</title>
   <shortdesc>A cloud computing software company has documentation with overview, procedural, specifications, troubleshooting, and glossary content.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>topic</keyword>
